OL,3,GNEWSADoctor who licked beer off
OL,4,Acolleague can work again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspended doctor who was accused of
OL,7,Fpouring beer down a younger colleague's
OL,8,Fcleavage before licking it off can
OL,9,Freturn to work.
OL,11,FDr Mark Johnson, who also allegedly
OL,12,Fsent "derogatory and sexually
OL,13,Fdemeaning" messages to another junior
OL,14,Fcolleague, was banned for 12 months in
OL,15,FNovember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
