OL,3,GNEWSADoctor who licked beer off
OL,4,Acolleague can work again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Medical Practitioners Tribunal
OL,7,FService (MPT) ruled that the actions of
OL,8,FDr Johnson, who was working at West
OL,9,FSuffolk Hospital at the time of the
OL,10,Fincidents, constituted sexual
OL,11,Fharassment but not "predatory
OL,12,Fbehaviour".
OL,14,FBut, following a review hearing, a
OL,15,Fpanel concluded his fitness to practise
OL,16,Fwas no longer impaired, paving the way
OL,17,Ffor him to return to the profession.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
